	<annotations>
		<text id="0" type="text/markdown" rect="(80.0, 330.0, 460.0, 110.0)" font-family="Sans Serif" font-size="16">*Chapter 5, 5B. Corpus: move Title to Ignored so only Content is used. Preprocess Text: Lowercase, Regexp, English stopwords, then add Numbers and Document frequency (relative 0.01 to 0.3). Topic Modelling: choose Latent Dirichlet Allocation and 3 topics.*</text>
	</annotations>
